# lahn exercise
version 1
type neck
title Learn the neck
category Fretboard
author lahn
description A scale in one place on the neck, played up and down, in thirds, in triads, or one note on every string. Change the key, the scale, the shape and the position as you go: your times are kept, and the neck shows which notes you find slowly.
key C
scale major
fingering position
position 7
pattern straight
instrument guitar
